 "source_file": "corpus/src/kotlin/when.kt",
 "source": "// when is Kotlin's exhaustiveness-shaped dispatch expression.\n\nfun classify(x: Any): String =\n    when (x) { // subject\n        is String -> x.uppercase()\n        is Int -> x + 1\n        0, 1, 2 -> \"small\" // comma-separated conditions\n        in 10..20 -> \"mid\"\n        !in 100..200 -> \"not-large\"\n        else -> \"other\"\n    }\n\nfun noSubject(flag: Boolean): Int {\n    return when {\n        flag -> 1\n        else -> 0 // no-subject when\n    }\n}\n",
